      "Generates a photo of the actual image, 9:16, a real phone-photo-photo sense.\n\nThe picture is of a 20-year-old Eastern female model who stands at the indoor fair, taking pictures of her in the near-image.\n\nThe person's posture is natural, with a slight forwarding, a soft and stretching neck, a natural beam on the waist, and a mature, soft female S-type curve on the body. The body is mature and full of fine shoulders, a soft shoulder, full of natural breasts, clear but not over-flipped waist lines, a roundly hip curve, a soft and healthy flesh feeling of thighs and arms, and a whole body of gentle, sweet, plentiful, elegant female beauty.\n\nThe characters' clothing is “articulate graffiti made of neon-hand line drawing”, with a pen that is deliberately rough and random, with a clear crayon and marker hand-painting sense. The doodle graphs in the picture form a visual illusion, highlight body lines and fine contours, make people look like they are wearing a cosplay outfit made of neon lines, and avoid being presented as real fabric.\n\nThe person's hair is a fine, old ponytail, with white flower headdress, crystal hair, rhussor, and lacquer.\n\nThe scene is a large indoor exhibition site with crowds and stands in a slightly reduced setting, and a real gallery light on the top. The picture is based on a near-view picture, a clear face and clothing, a distorted background, and a sense of self-image with a real mobile phone.\n\nThe whole style: writing, luminous, bright, dreamy.",
