    title: 'The woman with the back of the light.',
    prompt:
      'The real message of the female mood of the back of the light:\n\nPlease create a vertical version of the high-quality female emotional reality, entitled "Retro-opportunity, female emotional reality".\n\nCore requirements:\nThe absolute focus of the picture is “back”, which presents women by showing their back structures, neck lines, shoulder pelvis, mid-wire spine lines, back curves and reverse contour. Please avoid the way in which ordinary women write real or common layouts, with the back being the main visual core, with the face only as a complement.\n\nNumber of character set:\nAdult women, who are natural, can be gentle, cold, lazy, literary, familiar or quiet. People don\'t have a red face, plastic sense, and don\'t exaggerate. They can look, look back, look down or close their eyes, but face is not the point.\n\nPosture requires:\nPostures must be served by back-to-back displays, such as a slight back-to-eye look, side-to-side stand, side-to-side sit, hand-to-head hair-to-head preparation, head-to-head strangulation, slop-to-window window, half-sliding eyes, and a lower coat. The movement is natural, not rigid, not looking straight at the lens.\n\nLeaning structures:\nThere must be a clear back-to-back design that allows for a high transition between low-back skirts, hammocks, de-back dress, knitting jackets, thin shawl, bathrobes, loose shirts, silk hoods, etc.\n\nClothing and materials:\nThe fabric is designed to form half-slides, slides, packages, hanging layers, but not heavy.\n\nScenes:\nThe scene is a bedroom, window edge, bed, white wall room, residential room, hotel room, wood space or retrofitted apartment.\n\nLight requires:\nThe main focus is to get the light to the back, to slit the edge of the shoulder neck, to the contours of the shoulder, to the waistline and to the high glow of the silk. The morning light, the golden light of the evening, the light of the fog, or the light of the cold white window are used, but the light of the back must be formed.\n\nChart:\nA vertical drawing can be made of 9:16, 3:4 or 4:5. The person is the absolute hero, with the visual focus on the back, neck and back curve.\n\n♪ The atmosphere:\nThe overall atmosphere is quiet, soft, private, restrained, and advanced, like the real photographer\'s film-sensored emotional writing. Focus on avoiding straight whiteness and sexyness, and on using "Mirth + Inverted Light + Soft fabric + Nature Posture" to express the beauty of women.\n\nPaint quality requirements:\nReal photography, film, soft film, thin colour, real skin, shallow view, light particle, image pervade nature. No AI plastic sense, no CG sense, no wrong fingers, no deformations, no cheap pornographic expression, no words, watermarks, Logo, border frames.\n\nFinal effect:\nA highly completed female emotional reality with the "breadback" as its main focus, with restraint and superior female beauty through defecation structures, backlines, soft light and soft fabric.',
