    sourceId: 'freestylefly-gpt-image-2',
    title: 'Commercial gallery visualization system at the enterprise level',
    prompt:
      'Please generate a business-level book vision for the project on the theme [brand name] [industry/ product/ solution].\n\nOverall style: High-end, professional, with strong visual impact; avoid traditional Word layout and common PPT sense. Use the style [Dark Technology aesthetics/ White Very Simple Business / High-end Industrial Wind / Artistic Brand Book].\n\nThe book contains:\n1. Cover and bottom\n2. Business introduction and branding\n3. Core products and technology advantages\n4. Application of scenarios and solutions\n5 Client cases and modes of cooperation\n6. Full-volume system preview\n\nRequests:\nThe layout needs a design sense, with clear lines of picture, title, data, icons, white and hierarchy; a brand-based visual system that maintains a single set of paintings; and a focus on the completion of real commercial material, avoiding simple text layout.\n\nStructure planning:\nCover / Seal: Create brand cover, industry quality and overall visual agility.\nBusiness Introduction Page: Description of corporate positioning, capacity boundaries and service audience.\n3. Product Technology Page: Demonstrating core products, technological advantages and solutions.\nApplication scene page: Show users what industries the product can be used for.\nCase / Cooperation page: Additional information on credibility and business transformation.\n6. Full-book preview: validates style uniformity and the system sense of the entire book.\n\nIf you have information on the business, you can upload the old business book, the company\'s presentation document, the product description, the content of the website, the PPT proposal, the product picture or case picture, so that ChatGPT can do three things:\n1. Re-structure content and determine what is appropriate for cover, business introduction, product pages, case pages and cooperation pages.\n2. The main line of the collection is to be refined to avoid a pile of information and requires a clear commercial narrative.\n3. To harmonize the visual direction and make the entire gallery look like a brand system and avoid different page spellings.\n\nPocket avoidance:\n1. Avoid saying "to produce a book" at all times, otherwise it is easy to become a template.\n2. Avoid a stack of text, and the collection must have product vision, scenery, data modules and design levels.\n3. Avoid generating single pages, preferably with a full preview to reflect the full sense of the system.',
