    id: 'freestylefly-gpt-image-2:b8aed072d29403ec',
    sourceId: 'freestylefly-gpt-image-2',
    title: 'A Chinese fitness profile.',
    prompt:
      'Please generate a Chinese fitness information map on the theme: [xx].\n\nThis chart is required to be both professional and practical and suitable for adults in general. The default target is a healthy adult without serious injuries or illness; the default target is “Impact + Basic Power Enhancement”, the default level of training is “Newman to Middle School”, the default training scene is “General gymnasium” and the default single training time is controlled within 40-60 minutes.\n\nPlease judge the type of output automatically according to [training theme]:\n\n1) If [the subject of training] is a muscle or body part (e.g. pectrob, back broad muscle, gib, abs, shoulder, leg, etc.), output an “Info on Training Program for the Department”.\n2) If [the subject of training] is an action or skill target (e.g., pull up, push-ups, arms stretching, crouching, etc.), output an " action unlocking / step training plan information map".\n\nThe entire picture is based on a clear, modern, professional, easy to read Chinese-language style, vertical layout, short-read, focused and suitable for social media sharing or training reference cards. Do not write a big story, each module is presented in a short short sentence and digital information is visible.\n\nThis information map must contain the following:\n\n[A. Title Area]\n- Main title: Directly write training program/ unlock program\nSubheading: Auto-addition of applicable population, targets, training scenes, suggested duration\nFor example, suitable for starters / amplification orientation / gym version / 45 minutes\n\n[B. Training Target Zone]\nIn simple language:\n- What\'s the main focus of this training?\n- What are the main objectives (fossil/power/ skills unlock/ core control etc.)\n- Focused on stimulation or capability improvement in this training\n\n[C. Warming Zone]\nGive 2-4 warm-up suggestions, and simply list them, for example:\n- Dynamic activities\n- Target muscle activated.\n- Lightweight preheater group.\nEach of these can be accompanied by a statement\n\nMain training area\nThis is the core, please list 4-6 major training actions.\nEach action must contain the following information:\n- Action name\n- Training role / Targeted area\n- Cluster x Number (or time)\n- RIR Recommendations\n- Break time per group\n- Key points of action (1 - 2)\n- Common error (one fine)\n\nMake sure the movement is properly organized:\n- We\'ll do it together, then we\'ll do it alone.\n- The overall level of training is moderate.\n- No, no, no, no, no.\n- On the initiative of normal advice, RIR 1-3.\n- Isolated action is recommended, RIR 0-2.\n- In the case of absteal or core type actions, in the form of "seconds/ times"\n- If a skill type action, prioritize "foremost capability action" + transition action + target action attempt"\n\n[E. Progress / Unlock Logic Zone]\nAuto-generated by theme:\n- If it is a mass training: "How to gradually overload" such as "a maximum number of times to increase, a standard of priority guaranteed action, etc.\n- If action is unlocked: write " step-by-step " , e.g., from strangulation, shoulder-to-spin pull, centrifugal training, ballistics, to standard action\n\nAlternative action area\nPlease give 2-3 alternative actions that apply to:\n- No equipment.\n- Home training.\n- There\'s not enough capacity.\n- Some moves can\'t be done.\n\n[G. Execute Reminder Area]\nPlease give 4-6 simple reminders, for example:\n- Action standards take precedence over weight.\n- Don\'t get all the strength of every team.\n- The specter suggested 48-72 hours.\n- Pain doesn\'t mean normal force.\n- A proper reduction in training in cases of inadequate sleep\n\nRETURN THE RECOMMENDED QUIPMENT\nSimplicity:\n- Recover focus after training\n- Protein / Sleep / Restoring interval advice\n- 1 sentence of risk reminder (to cease and assess if there is apparent pain)\n\n[I. Visual Design Requirements]\n- Chinese information diagrams in their entirety\n- A vertical layout.\n- Modern style, cleanness, professionalism, fitness.\n- Use modularized card layout\n- Focus numbers (groups, frequency, RIR, rest)\n- A simple human muscle icon, a dumb bell, a bell, a quote up small icon\n- Keep the color high, clean, moving.\n- Chinese must be clear, accurate and readable.\n- Avoid excessive decoration, emphasis on practicality and enforcement\n\nPlease output " a complete picture of the contents " , instead of just the normal paragraph text.',
